The return type and implementation is not matching. Expects to return an empty string, but is returning array or undefined.
 
Could possibly be simplified to this, if it should always return string. 

```suggestion
/**
 * Get classes from the db for the info item.
 * If there aren't any or if dbInfoItem isn't defined, return an empty string.
 * Else create 1 string from the list of classes found
 *
 * @param {undefined | null | object} dbInfoItem
 * @returns {string}
 */
function getStylesFromDbInfo(dbInfoItem) {
  return dbInfoItem?.styles ?? '';
}
```
